WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.038 --> 00:00:11.088
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:11.089 --> 00:00:18.352
What do they see?

3
00:00:18.353 --> 00:00:23.773
They see clay.

4
00:00:23.774 --> 00:00:30.317
Blobs, what will you make?

5
00:00:30.318 --> 00:00:40.264
They squeeze the clay.

6
00:00:40.265 --> 00:00:58.085
They press the clay.

7
00:00:58.086 --> 00:01:13.103
They pull the clay.

8
00:01:13.104 --> 00:01:34.981
They roll the clay.

9
00:01:34.982 --> 00:01:51.705
They spin the clay.

10
00:01:51.706 --> 00:01:57.915
They spin the clay really fast.

11
00:01:57.916 --> 00:02:04.511
That's too fast, blobs! Splat!

12
00:02:04.512 --> 00:02:08.182
Blobs? Where are you?

13
00:02:08.183 --> 00:02:17.429
Oh, there you are.

14
00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:26.479
Silly blobs.

15
00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:28.945
Good-bye!

